{"id":"n14585-1-7","stage":3,"title":"어리석다 · 愚蠢","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n14585-1-7-1","ko":"그때 우리가 왜 그랬을까?","zh":"那时候我们为什么会那么做呢？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그때","meaning":"那时，那时候","explanation":"그때：那时，那时候","readings":[{"term":"그때","audio":"/audio/2d0b6f3e4d1966c49aa8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29683","senseId":"1","lemma":"그때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그때","audio":"/audio/2d0b6f3e4d1966c49aa8.mp3"}},{"text":"우리가","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리가","audio":"/audio/49bdae052f6acaf1e2d7.mp3"}},{"text":"왜","meaning":"为什么","explanation":"왜：为什么","readings":[{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67848","senseId":"1","lemma":"왜","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"왜","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3"}},{"text":"그랬을까?","meaning":"那样做","explanation":"그러다：那样做；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"그러다","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"37062","senseId":"1","lemma":"그러다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그랬을까","audio":"/audio/8879e0e2815c9dc7e251.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2d0b6f3e4d1966c4","term":"그때","zh":"那时，那时候","audio":"/audio/2d0b6f3e4d1966c49aa8.mp3","entryId":"29683","definition":"前面所说的某一时间。","pronunciation":["그때"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"08b35eb63efd4aaa","term":"왜","zh":"为什么","audio":"/audio/08b35eb63efd4aaae44c.mp3","entryId":"67848","definition":"因什么原因；或指怎么。","pronunciation":["왜ː"]},{"id":"5cc953af09d8c68c","term":"그러다","zh":"那样做","audio":"/audio/5cc953af09d8c68cfb6d.mp3","entryId":"37062","definition":"那样做","pronunciation":["그러다"]}],"audio":"/audio/7b49086efeec7dc074ac.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n14585-1-7-2","ko":"어렸을 때 한 행동이긴 했지만 우리도 참 어리석었지.","zh":"虽然那是小时候的行为，但我们当时也真是太愚蠢了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어렸을","meaning":"年幼、年龄小","explanation":"어리다：年幼、年龄小；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；을：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"어리다","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74176","senseId":"1","lemma":"어리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어렸을","audio":"/audio/314f3a56783f02be9cd3.mp3"}},{"text":"때","meaning":"时，时候","explanation":"때：时，时候","readings":[{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74123","senseId":"1","lemma":"때","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"때","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3"}},{"text":"한","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；ㄴ：修饰后面的名词。形容词后表示当前性质；动词后通常表示已完成的动作或结果状态。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한","audio":"/audio/89233692031a62c60e6e.mp3"}},{"text":"행동이긴","meaning":"行动，行为，举动","explanation":"행동：行动，行为，举动；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；기：将前面的动作或状态转成名词性表达。；ㄴ：은/는 的缩略，标记话题或对比，如 난＝나는。","readings":[{"term":"행동","audio":"/audio/c0a59131a2a5be2a5183.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72478","senseId":"1","lemma":"행동","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"행동이긴","audio":"/audio/bd18f006acd9a9b9fc1c.mp3"}},{"text":"했지만","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지만：表示转折或让步：“但是、虽然”。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"했지만","audio":"/audio/c7f6442815fb12a3f118.mp3"}},{"text":"우리도","meaning":"我们","explanation":"우리：我们；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"2","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"우리도","audio":"/audio/e38d802f2fea2ee2a659.mp3"}},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}},{"text":"어리석었지.","meaning":"愚蠢，傻","explanation":"어리석다：愚蠢，傻；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；지：表示确认、提醒、意愿或自问等，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"어리석다","audio":"/audio/bdf7816b3a5f4e4d1b33.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"14585","senseId":"1","lemma":"어리석다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어리석었지","audio":"/audio/3ffe0640522e8f4b55d9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ec54bee5939613d4","term":"어리다","zh":"年幼、年龄小","audio":"/audio/ec54bee5939613d498c9.mp3","entryId":"74176","definition":"年纪小。","pronunciation":["어리다"]},{"id":"43bc9c47e0f938b1","term":"때","zh":"时，时候","audio":"/audio/43bc9c47e0f938b11288.mp3","entryId":"74123","definition":"指某一瞬间或时间段。","pronunciation":["때"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"进行某种行动、动作或活动。","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"c0a59131a2a5be2a","term":"행동","zh":"行动，行为，举动","audio":"/audio/c0a59131a2a5be2a5183.mp3","entryId":"72478","definition":"活动身体做某种事情或动作。","pronunciation":["행동"]},{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己在内的一些人。一般对没有自己身份地位高的人使用。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"bdf7816b3a5f4e4d","term":"